OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after drugs worth #2.4
OL,4,Amillion seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuspected drugs worth #2.4m were seized
OL,7,Fby detectives, following the search of
OL,8,Fa vehicle in Lisburn on Tuesday.
OL,10,FA 41-year-old man has been charged with
OL,11,Fa number of drug and motoring offences.
OL,13,FHe is due to appear at Lisburn
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday.
OL,16,FThe drugs were found after police
OL,17,Fofficers on patrol stopped a suspicious
OL,18,Fvehicle in the Hillsborough Road area
OL,19,Fof the city at around 21:15 BST.
